msgstr "The age-adjusted rate applies the Segi–Doll standard population to the available age groups. If coverage is missing for any required group, “—” is shown. The formula, denominators, and presentation of methods still require review with the RNC."

#: public_site/public_forms.py static/js/unified-consult.js
